WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
What about Sun Yan? Do you love her? No.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,800
Her father got me a better position

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,800
Yueyue Tangyang

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,000
or anyone

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
who is most important to you

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:19,900
Only my own mother

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:23,250
Give me the knife. In my previous life, my mother was soft-hearted.

8
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:24,450
Put them into the home

9
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:26,100
also hurt you

10
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:28,340
I am cowardly for once in my life

11
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,340
Let mom be brave once

12
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,340
But you shouldn't bear it for me

13
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,780
You have already died for me once

14
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,380
Mom can't let these people anymore

15
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:35,780
dirty your hands

16
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,180
Please take Yueyue out
